      "If people need a dog capable of protecting, gripping, accompanying, confronting a powerful animal, and at the same time remaining under control, those qualities can be sought many times in history. They can travel through real dogs. They can also reappear because the same function selects toward similar solutions.",
      "And then the question becomes more honest:",
      "What can we document, what can we consider probable, and what remains a possibility?",
